#: ../../modules/index.md:25
msgid "Runtime"
msgstr "运行时模块（Runtime）"

#: ../../modules/index.md:55
msgid "Development"
msgstr "开发模块（Development）"

#: ../../modules/index.md:63
msgid "Prefabs"
msgstr "预制件（Prefabs）"

#: ../../modules/index.md:5 e60b4357ffe242c4be75739b9a3d5323
msgid "🧩 Modules"
msgstr "🧩 模块"

#: ../../modules/index.md:7 90c8bfdce53b4cce84219e9582a97841
msgid "Bookshelf is designed with modularity in mind. Features that serve a common purpose are organized into distinct, standalone, namespaced modules."
msgstr "Bookshelf 采用模块化设计理念，将实现相近功能的特性归入独立的命名空间模块。"

#: ../../modules/index.md:11 4faa778e54eb46fca5cf9657ddf27e0f
msgid "🌟 Featured Modules"
msgstr "🌟 精选模块"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:5 6cba33837ddf409588ec0fd2d22a6d3d
msgid "🧱 Block"
msgstr "🧱 方块"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:10 1d1d4b2dead14f4cb3f76fe8811d9546
msgid "Get and manipulate blocks (supports block states and NBTs)."
msgstr "获取并操作方块（支持方块状态和NBT标签）。"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:13 8b89295f98d84673901a88531b60c25d
msgid "🔦 Raycast"
msgstr "🔦 光线投射"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:18 27db8125fb424020a9b2c9cdbb11dd2d
msgid "Cast rays and see if they collide with blocks or entities."
msgstr "投射光线并检测它们是否与方块或实体发生碰撞。"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:21 dfcbc1de43c746f38a23421a2d6e9581
msgid "🧮 Math"
msgstr "🧮 数学"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:26 b3fcee147837492fb3501b4f666ed229
msgid "Mathematical functions: sin, cos, exp, log, sqrt, and much more!"
msgstr "数学函数：三角函数、指数、对数、开方等等！"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:29 96bfee2015db42cc8f8aa1aa0f8a5ea8
msgid "🏗️ Generation"
msgstr "🏗️ 生成"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:34 5185d12107874c7fb2fb0d21b16159ed
msgid "Iterate efficiently over the world to generate terrains and landscapes."
msgstr "高效遍历世界以生成地形和景观。"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:37 6fe68c4d15b642c4aefdc61be88ee2ee
msgid "🎲 Random"
msgstr "🎲 随机"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:42 8712ed3c4d874f8d992b3328ab7da163
msgid "Random functions for different distributions and noise patterns."
msgstr "用于不同分布和噪声模式的随机函数。"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:45 ec5f654a5c7a48609e12435117a20206
msgid "❤️ Health"
msgstr "❤️ 生命"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:50 c9574dc2d16e4049a75b82a79a238849
msgid "Easily manage the health of a player or the lifetime of an entity!"
msgstr "轻松管理玩家的生命值或实体的生命周期！"

#: ../../modules/index.md:18 6c89fc94ee534a879ffbdfe7bd6990fa
msgid "📖 Key Definitions"
msgstr "📖 关键概念"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:2 3d7140cbdf404729886b7fcefbf0a270
msgid "General Concepts"
msgstr "通用概念"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:3 e09c32a05d114daaa9f9ffde8ea42475
msgid "**Bundle**"
msgstr "**捆绑包**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:4 9d9dcf1665aa487f8f65535f386b2405
msgid "A set of modules packaged together for distribution."
msgstr "一组打包在一起用于分发的模块。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:5 010a6f978f83424582779f99547c17be
msgid "**Dependency**"
msgstr "**依赖项**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:6 c3ad2a25e5084928982e01ecdb60cf73
msgid "A module that another module relies on to function properly. It must be loaded for the dependent module to work."
msgstr "其他模块正常运行所依赖的模块。依赖项必须被加载才能让依赖它的模块正常工作。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:7 ef644c259afd4448adb76ace0fc32518
msgid "**Feature**"
msgstr "**特性**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:8 cd4649d389e94b59a983822d592ee065
msgid "A user-facing element designed to accomplish a task. Features are often represented as function tags, but can also include loot tables, structures, predicates, and more."
msgstr "一个面向用户的、用于完成特定任务的元素。特性通常表现为函数标签，但也可以包括战利品表、结构、谓词等。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:9 6a2ce4189e38440893bd98bd4ab948e7
msgid "**Module**"
msgstr "**模块**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:10 d76661060e8545f3bfe3ae0e80f38860
msgid "A collection of related features within a namespace, serving a specific purpose."
msgstr "在同一命名空间内服务于特定目的的相关特性的集合。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:11 e501b8349142498aa816cd35a9cb1d56
msgid "**Weak Dependency**"
msgstr "**弱依赖项**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:12 21220df0d426485695ade6b1cb2b062f
msgid "An optional dependency that enhances functionality if present, but is not essential for the main module to function correctly."
msgstr "可选的依赖项，存在时可以增强功能，但对主模块的正常运行不是必需的。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:15 d026dafeb83a4fae9add5edb8ab8a2b7
msgid "Special Arguments"
msgstr "特殊参数"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:16 b43e42672e8a4464aa71eec7f8680125
msgid "**`on_*`**"
msgstr "**`on_*`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:17 bc37919ddd1a457b978a0e84e0ad552e
msgid "Specifies a command to be executed by a feature when a particular event occurs."
msgstr "指定在特定事件发生时由特性执行的命令。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:18 83de5cdcb5f5477e845570ee87933321
msgid "**`run`**"
msgstr "**`run`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:19 0c5df0af5d804301a9ca2e673fe90434
msgid "Specifies a command to be executed by a feature, often immediately."
msgstr "指定由特性执行的命令，通常是立即执行。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:20 cecfc4715faf4acfaf5dd27a23c7ecdf
msgid "**`with`**"
msgstr "**`with`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:21 cc11bd9abcb1448db13fdbb2ca1ea748
msgid "Specifies optional arguments."
msgstr "指定可选参数。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:24 99d6f5b4a5eb4b87a9ce462d18683750
msgid "Special Functions"
msgstr "特殊函数"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:25 faaeddb110c840549c14f6d34dea81bf
msgid "**`*_ata`**"
msgstr "**`*_ata`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:26 bf20e038f68d41779a023e8c2e2d82c1
msgid "Shortened from \"as to at.\" These functions take two positions: one given through a positional argument (e.g., `positioned`, `at`), and the other from the executor's position."
msgstr "缩写自“as to at”。这些函数接受两个位置：一个通过位置参数给出（如 `positioned`、`at`），另一个来自执行者的位置。"

#~ msgid "Generate terrains and landscapes, incorporating natural features."
#~ msgstr "生成包含自然地貌的地形和景观。"
